---
import SiteLayout from "@/layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import CreatorArt from "@/components/art/CreatorArt.astro";
import { nariLinks } from "@/data/socials";
import { ArrowUpRight } from "@lucide/vue";
const youtube = nariLinks.find(({ platform }) => platform === "youtube")!;
---
<SiteLayout pageId="nailStudio">
  <section class="nails-opening page-width">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Creativity, the Nari way</p><h1>A little color.<br /><em>A lot of curiosity.</em></h1><p class="intro-line">Polish, games, and making things her own.</p><p>Nari is self-taught, still practicing, and learning one tiny detail at a time. Color, process, and a frankly unreasonable affection for nail polish all belong here. So do the games and videos that bring out her creative side.</p><a class="text-link" href={youtube.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Find her creative videos <ArrowUpRight size={16} aria-hidden="true" /><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></div>
    <figure class="nail-muse"><CreatorArt asset="nails" sizes="(min-width: 48rem) 360px, 270px" eager priority /><figcaption>A little polish, a little patience.<br />Illustration, not Nari's nail work.</figcaption><a class="art-credit" href="/credits/#website-storybook-artwork">Illustration credits</a></figure>
  </section>
  <nav class="creative-paths page-width" aria-label="Explore Nari’s creativity"><a href="#nail-desk">At the nail desk</a><a href="#game-pile">Games & curiosity</a><a href="#creator-shelf">On camera</a></nav>
  <section id="nail-desk" class="studio-notes page-width" aria-labelledby="practice-title">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">The practice</p><h2 id="practice-title">One set.<br /><em>Then the next.</em></h2><p>Color, tiny details, glitter experiments, and honest practice on her own nails.</p></div>
    <div><p class="eyebrow">The real-work collection</p><h2>The gallery is waiting<br />for the real thing.</h2><p>Nari's own approved photographs will go here. Until then, there is no stand-in portfolio. Figuring it out is part of the fun.</p><p class="small-note">Personal practice and self-taught nail art. No salon services or bookings.</p></div>
  </section>
  <section class="creative-interests page-width" aria-labelledby="creative-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">Beyond the polish</p><h2 id="creative-title">Curiosity goes <em>everywhere.</em></h2></div><article id="game-pile"><h3>Games & glorious panic</h3><p>Playing, trying things, getting distracted, and finding a moment worth sharing. The game is only part of the fun.</p><a class="text-link" href="/links/#moments">See a few favorite moments <ArrowUpRight size={15} aria-hidden="true" /></a></article><article id="creator-shelf"><h3>A little Nari, on camera</h3><p>Streams, Shorts, nail content, and highlights. Different ways to make something that feels like her.</p><a class="text-link" href={youtube.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore her videos <ArrowUpRight size={15} aria-hidden="true" /><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></article></section>
</SiteLayout>
